    {
      "id": "claim_b81126ddc4c14647a1a24e207e01be53",
      "statement": "Configuration is resolved in a fixed three-layer precedence: CLI flags override a project's .docsweep.yaml, which overrides the global ~/.docsweep/config.yaml, so a user who only maintains the global file experiences a single effective configuration layer.",
