      "statement": "scan_records() first tries to satisfy read-heavy queries from the optional SQLite index at ~/.docsweep/index.db, scopes any returned records to the currently configured roots, treats an index that resolves to zero in-scope records as a cache miss, and falls back to a full run_scan() in that case or on any exception.",
